// Should fail without fs permission when reading.
// Run with: rite run tests/e2e/permission_denied.rite
// (no --allow-all)
//
// The `!` is what makes this a *permission* test: reads are effects, so
// without the marker the run stops at `rite check` with E021 and never
// reaches the permission layer at all.
result ← ! @fs.read("/etc/passwd")
result
